OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 30 Sep to Fri 9 Oct
OL,6,FRemaining changeable as Atlantic
OL,7,Ffrontal systems bring spells of rain,
OL,8,Fshowers and occasional strong winds.
OL,9,FThe wettest and windiest conditions
OL,10,Fwill tend to be most frequent across
OL,11,Fwestern areas, with longer drier
OL,12,Finterludes most favoured in the far
OL,13,Feast and southeast, where it may be
OL,14,Fvery warm at times. Into October, high
OL,15,Fpressure to the northeast of the UK
OL,16,Fmay become more influential on the
OL,17,Fweather, with some longer drier
OL,18,Finterludes focussed more across the
OL,19,Fnorth and northeast of the UK, whilst
OL,20,Foccasional rain may tend to be more
OL,21,Fprevalent towards the south and west.
OL,22,FTemperatures are expected to be above
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Faverage for the period as a whole.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
