OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 10 Oct to Sat 24 Oct
OL,6,FInitially, high pressure may be
OL,7,Fcentred to the north or northeast,
OL,8,Fwith longer drier periods more likely
OL,9,Facross northern UK, whilst low
OL,10,Fpressure to the southwest brings
OL,11,Foccasional rain or showers into more
OL,12,Fsouthern and western parts. Towards
OL,13,Fand beyond mid-October, it may turn
OL,14,Fmore widely unsettled with a greater
OL,15,Fchance of wet and windy conditions at
OL,16,Ftimes. Temperatures will likely be
OL,17,Fabove average for the period as a
OL,18,Fwhole.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
